  "notes": "v3: added weakDirectionKeywords, the markers that prove a transaction without saying which way money moved. They stay listed under spend/receive so this file keeps working unchanged on older apps; apps that understand the field let 'credited' outrank a bare 'Txn ID', which was booking Airtel Payments Bank style credit alerts as debits. v2: added Dr./Cr. debit-credit markers used by Canara Bank style alerts; excluded YES Bank 'require consent' disbursement promos. Keyword matching is whole-word from app 2.2.1 onward.",
